.el .ds Aq '
.TH stool-init 1  "stool-init "
.SH NAME
stool\-init \- Save dotfiles defaults, initialize Apple settings and optionally restore offline keys
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstool\-init\fR [\fB\-\-dotfile\-url\fR] [\fB\-\-key\-file\fR] [\fB\-\-brewfile\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-\-passphrase\-file\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Save dotfiles defaults, initialize Apple settings and optionally restore offline keys
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-dotfile\-url\fR \fI<URL>\fR
Default Git URL; saved without cloning or contacting the repository
.TP
\fB\-\-key\-file\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Password\-encrypted offline archive produced by stool secrets backup
.TP
\fB\-\-brewfile\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Trusted local Brewfile (defaults to ~/.Brewfile; missing default is skipped)
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Preview without saving configuration, decrypting keys or changing the system
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Allow package installation without terminal input; prepare privileges separately
.TP
\fB\-\-passphrase\-file\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Private external backup password file (requires \-\-key\-file)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
